  unitName: Fire King Vargas
  unitId: 10013
  unitNumber: 3
  description: A swordsman from the ruined Agni Empire, he later became one of the
    Six Heroes. Through harsh training, he mastered the use of a fire-encased long
    sword to make himself an even match to Lava, the swordswoman he once lost to.
    He's since become a drifter, not returning to the Order of Agni, but he still
    remains a legend.
  summonDesc: Wanna know who I am, huh?<br>Alright then, lemme show you...<br>with
    my sword of fire!
  fusionDesc: You wanna test my strength?<br>Just watch, I'll get <br>even stronger!
  evoDesc: My sword encased in fire <br>will burn this image into <br>your mind!
  element: 1
  rarity: 3
